      "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:36:55.059Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/prasant_pant\">@Prasant_Pant</a> ,<br>\nfor HTML field you should fill Options of the field. In client script use frm.set_df_property(fieldname,”options”, html_code).</p>\n<p>Thank you.<br>\nJiří Šír</p>",
